egni. Ma la morte del padre la costringe a tornare a Buenos Aires e ad affrontare la rivalità con i due fratelli e I segreti del padre. Confrontandosi con la complicata eredità familiare Sofia vuole dimostrare di non essere solo una viziata festaiola."},{"language":"en-US","title":"LIMBO... Until I Decide","overview":"As an heiress to her family’s business empire, Sofía lives an opulent life free of responsibilities and commitments. But when her father passes away, Sofía is forced to return to her birthplace, Buenos Aires, to confront her rivalry with her two brothers and her father's secrets. In facing her complicated family legacy, Sofía sets out to prove that she’s more than a spoiled party girl."},{"language":"es-ES","title":"Limbo… hasta que lo decida","overview":"Como heredera del imperio empresarial de su familia, Sofía vive una vida opulenta libre de responsabilidades y compromisos. Pero cuando su padre fallece, Sofía se ve obligada a regresar a su ciudad natal, Buenos Aires, para enfrentarse a la rivalidad con sus dos hermanos y a los secretos de su padre. Al enfrentarse a su complicado legado familiar, Sofía se propone demostrar que es algo más que una fiestera mimada."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xutkCwxnijKGtcap9lZH6ra3RwB.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fdMBv1njQS9aFncfp4GCTpBFEX8.jpg","seasons":[{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2022,"episodeCount":10,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l2lLcrfNONW2eaXWVg0k8o7Twmt.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/122045/season/1"}],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":122045,"type":"tv","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dQWvLPD2UXTtayfzX3tWzlN